      "side": 1,
      "message": "The preceding method ImageVariant() is provided for the use of cc and a couple of packages that have to handle cc modules (apex) or compile to platform specific code (rust). The arch/image mutators (all of which are provided by android) are similar. As are Target, ArchType, etc. Many different packages from java, cc, rust, apex already have to deal with \"link\" so I don\u0027t see why adding it here would be an issue.\n\nIf you would prefer I can always go back to the previous approach which provided a general method to get access to the variation by mutator name.",
